# Architecture

Read `ARCHITECTURE.md` before adding routes, providers, services, or shared data/state.

Inspect the current module’s pattern before introducing a new one. Mixed React Query, `fetch`, and browser Supabase access already coexist; do not “standardise” the repository in the same change.

Auth is a custom app session plus a short-lived Supabase data token. Do not describe or implement it as “Supabase Auth is the browser session.”

Daily Allocation product invariants live in `PRODUCT.md`. Do not copy that PRD into new architecture notes.
